cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the SPIROS 2026 checklist or this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SPIROS 2026: Standardized Protocol Items Recommendations for Observational Studies"
abstract: >-
  SPIROS 2026 is a reporting guideline for the minimum content of protocols of
  observational studies (cohort, case-control and cross-sectional designs). This
  repository holds the 33-item checklist as an interactive web tool, a feedback
  form and the supporting documentation.
type: software
